    (property "Note" "Common pin on the sense node, K2 to 5V_MAIN: holds the comparator input inside its rail when VIN is at 73.3 V. A1 OPEN -- the lower diode would clamp the negative excursion the comparator exists to see. Leakage lifts the sense node, which makes the clamp release EARLIER, the safe direction." (id 6) (at 190.0 256.0 0)
